1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,690
Who doesn't love a train?
谁会不喜欢火车呢？

2
00:00:02,690 --> 00:00:14,260
Since the invention of the first steam-powered locomotive in the UK in 1804, this powerful mode of transport has helped keep human progress on track.
1804年，英国发明了第一台蒸汽机车，自此以后，这种强大的交通工具一直推动着人类的发展稳步前行。

3
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:19,850
If they weren't hauling freight in cars, they'd be pulling passengers in carriages.
火车不是用货运车厢运输货物，就是用客运车厢搭载旅客。

4
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:25,810
In the modern era, the iron horse is still chugging along under its own steam.
在现代社会，这匹“钢铁骏马”依旧依靠自身动力稳步驰骋。

5
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:32,880
And these days, many are attracted to it for its comfort, style and luxury.
如今，许多人被火车的舒适、格调与奢华所吸引。

6
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:41,660
In the UK, a new £150m fleet of Caledonian Sleepers has just been unveiled.
在英国，价值1.5亿英镑的全新“喀里多尼亚卧铺列车”车队刚刚亮相。

7
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:55,490
These overnight trains provide an experience that will 'transform travel between London and Scotland,' says Ryan Flaherty of Serco, the company operating the rail service, in a BBC article.
运营这条铁路线路的瑟科公司的瑞安·弗莱厄蒂在接受英国广播公司采访时表示，这些夜间列车带来的体验将“改变伦敦与苏格兰之间的旅行方式”。

8
00:00:55,490 --> 00:01:08,430
Indeed, the fleet features 40 sleeper carriages fitted with showers, a club car for dining and new engineering in the couplers to prevent shunting from waking resting passengers.
事实上，这支列车编队配备了40节卧铺车厢，车厢内设有淋浴间，还有一节供乘客用餐的俱乐部车厢，车钩处也采用了全新的设计工艺，防止调车作业的动静吵醒休息的旅客。

9
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:11,510
But it doesn't stop there.
但奢华列车的魅力远不止于此。

10
00:01:11,510 --> 00:01:20,030
All over the globe, luxury trains deliver comfort and opulence on rails to passengers looking to let off steam.
在全球范围内，奢华列车都在为想要放松身心的旅客提供舒适奢华的铁路旅行体验。

11
00:01:20,030 --> 00:01:24,740
Why not try a whistle-stop tour of India on The Maharajas' Express?
何不在“王公快车”上开启一场印度短途观光之旅呢？

12
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:34,060
Taking 88 guests at a time on a four or eight-night trip, the train boasts restaurant cars, a bar and a lounge.
这趟列车每次可搭载88名乘客，行程分为四晚和八晚两种，列车上配有餐车、酒吧和休息厅。

13
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:46,300
If South Africa is more to your taste, you can travel for over 31 hours from Cape Town to Pretoria in a spacious cabin boasting five-star service on The Blue Train.
如果你更喜欢南非，不妨搭乘“蓝色列车”，在宽敞的车厢里享受五星级服务，从开普敦到比勒陀利亚，全程历时31个多小时。

14
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:48,520
Fancy South America?
对南美洲感兴趣？

15
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:53,170
The Belmond Andean Explorer is its first sleeper train.
“贝尔蒙德安第斯探索者号”是当地的首趟卧铺列车。

16
00:01:53,170 --> 00:01:56,910
They boast it is one of the highest train routes in the world.
据称，这趟列车的运行线路是全球海拔最高的铁路线路之一。

17
00:01:56,910 --> 00:02:04,170
It can whisk you across Peru from Cusco, the Incan capital, to Arequipa, 'the White City'.
它能载着你穿越秘鲁，从印加古都库斯科一路前往“白城”阿雷基帕。

18
00:02:04,170 --> 00:02:16,850
And of course, no mention of locomotive luxury would be complete without the famous Venice Simplon-Orient-Express, the well-known setting of a popular murder mystery novel.
当然，提到奢华列车，就不得不提著名的“威尼斯-辛普伦东方快车”——一部热门悬疑谋杀小说的故事就发生在这里。

19
00:02:16,850 --> 00:02:28,610
Travelling across Europe to various destinations such as London, Paris and Venice, its art deco cabins are manned by stewards and feature a resident pianist.
这趟列车穿梭于欧洲各地，终点涵盖伦敦、巴黎、威尼斯等多个城市，其装饰艺术风格的车厢配有乘务人员，还常驻着一位钢琴师。

20
00:02:28,610 --> 00:02:30,580
Trains are old.
火车已经存在许久了。

21
00:02:30,580 --> 00:02:35,180
And it is perhaps this age that appeals to many people.
或许正是这份历史感吸引了许多人。

22
00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:45,010
Stepping on board a luxury train to travel as we used to long ago evokes romantic memories of grand journeys at a more measured pace.
登上一列奢华列车，像很久以前那样旅行，能唤起人们对往昔从容惬意的盛大旅行的浪漫回忆。

23
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:49,670
If this appeals to you, why not consider one for your next holiday?
如果你也被这种旅行方式打动，下次度假时为何不考虑尝试一下呢？

24
00:02:49,670 --> 00:02:54,140
I'm sure your experience will be anything but a train wreck.
我敢肯定，你的体验绝对不会是一场“灾难”。
